/target

# Node / tooling deps (web visual tests, docs-site)
node_modules/
**/node_modules/

# Playwright visual-test output
tests/visual/shots/
tests/visual/test-results/
tests/visual/playwright-report/

# koda keeps transcripts, learned rules and the search index in its own data
# directory now, keyed by project, so none of them land here any more. These
# entries stay for checkouts that still have the old in-project directories —
# koda moves them out on first run, and these keep them quiet until it does.
.koda/sessions/
.koda/learning/
.koda/index/
# Project memory does still live here. It is knowledge about this project, so
# it is a reasonable thing to commit; ignored by default because it is written
# by the agent rather than by a person.
.koda/memory.md

# Built docs-site output
docs-site/dist/

# Rust build output in example projects (source-less build artifacts)
examples/**/target/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
